3.3.26 8:47 pm

Q: currently feeling overwhelmed by the power of art, how might i go about channeling this into my own art?;;;;;;

A: no one knows exactly

3.22.26 9:13 pm

Q: what should i do if i want to show more people the things i make, but im not ready to do something like putting them on the internet;;;;;;;;

A: maybe you can put them in a very quiet place on the internet where no one will find them yet
